nTouch me like you do, ta-ta-touch me like you do\nWhat are you waiting for?\n\nI'll let you set the pace\nCause I'm not thinking straight\nMy head's spinning around, I can't see clear no more\nWhat are you waiting for?\n\nLove me like you do, la-la-love me like you do\nLove me like you do, la-la-love me like you do\nTouch me like you do, ta-ta-touch me like you do\nWhat are you waiting for?\nLove me like you do, la-la-love me like you do\nLove me like you do, la-la-love me like you do\nTouch me like you do, ta-ta-touch me like you do\nWhat are you waiting for?\n\n#EllieGoulding #lovemelikeyoudo #officialvideo\n\n\nMusic video by Ellie Goulding performing Love Me Like You Do. (C) 2015 Polydor Ltd. (UK)","channel_id":"UCvu362oukLMN1miydXcLxGg","channel_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCvu362oukLMN1miydXcLxGg","duration":249,"view_count":2394097444,"average_rating":null,"age_limit":0,"webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AJtDXIazrMo","categories":["Music"],"tags":["Love Me Like You Do","Love","Like","You","Ellie Goulding","Ellie","Goulding","Official Video","Music Video","Music","Official Audio","Official","Video","Audio","Brightest Blue","Delirium","Hate Me","Close To Me","Sixteen","Slow Grenade","Fifty Shades Of Grey","Fifty Shade Grey","50 Shade Grey","50 Shades","Georgia Hudson","Fifty Shades Darker","Your song","Lights","Ellie Goulding Army","Falling","Ellie Golding","Eli Golding","Eli Goulding"],"playable_in_embed":true,"live_status":"not_live","media_type":"video","release_timestamp":null,"_format_sort_fields":["quality","res","fps","hdr:12","source","vcodec","channels","acodec","lang","proto"],"automatic_captions":{"zh-Hans":[{"url":"https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_timedtext_playlist/expire/1767804487/ei/5zleaeCQDKWPssUPkNT9oAc/ip/103.47.75.248/id/009b435c86b3acca/source/youtube/requiressl/yes/dur/249.200/tts_params/caps%3Dasr%26v%3DAJtDXIazrMo%26lang%3Dzh-Hans%26name%3DChinese+-+Simplified%26ip%3D103.47.75.248%26ipbits%3D0%26e