 until I feel your touch\n\n#TheWeeknd #BlindingLights\n\n\nMusic video by The Weeknd performing Blinding Lights. © 2020 The Weeknd XO, Inc., manufactured and marketed by Republic Records, a division of UMG Recordings, Inc.","channel_id":"UCF_fDSgPpBQuh1MsUTgIARQ","channel_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF_fDSgPpBQuh1MsUTgIARQ","duration":263,"view_count":994512606,"average_rating":null,"age_limit":0,"webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4NRXx6U8ABQ","categories":["Music"],"tags":["The","Weeknd","Blinding","Lights","Republic","Records","The Weeknd","The Weekend","TikTok","Superbowl","NFL","Blinding Lights","blinded by the lights","ザ・ウィークエンド","위켄드","한글자막","日本語字幕","subtítulos en español","Türkçe Altyazılı","Phụ đề tiếng Việt","Subtitles in Tagalog","Teks dalam Bahasa Indonesia","उपशीर्षक हिंदी में","Sarikata Dalam Bahasa Malaysia","คำบรรยายภาษาไทย"],"playable_in_embed":true,"live_status":"not_live","media_type":"video","release_timestamp":1579629610,"_format_sort_fields":["quality","res","fps","hdr:12","source","vcodec","channels","acodec","lang","proto"],"automatic_captions":{"en":[{"url":"https://manifest.googlevideo.com/api/manifest/hls_timedtext_playlist/expire/1767807320/ei/-EReab-QCvXzg8UP157puQQ/ip/103.47.75.255/id/e0d457c7a53c0014/source/youtube/requiressl/yes/dur/262.512/tts_params/caps%3Dasr%26v%3D4NRXx6U8ABQ%26lang%3Den%26name%3Den%26ip%3D103.47.75.255%26ipbits%3D0%26expire%3D1767807320%26sparams%3Dip,ipbits,expire,caps,v%26signature%3D106FC7F0BF7AC40A8BFDD9ABF1E383CB324C34E6.5CC496E2E843D3627FE6729D3AEFA88F1A5DF0A6%26key%3Ddg_yt0/rqh/4/hls_chunk_host/rr3---sn-2gxjpv0noxujvh-qxas.googlevideo.com/xpc/EgVo2aDSNQ%3D%3D/cps/406/met/1767785720,/mh/j6/mm/31,29/mn/sn-2gxjpv0noxujvh-qxas,sn-qxaeenlz/ms/au,rdu/mv/u/mvi/3/pl/24/rms/au,au/force_finished/1/gcr/in/bui/AYUSA3AegE1qo4DkupKDVoq2C6_RphRKTLiWfrDJ9ag5Z2MP3fYNhM2vl_DEezjygUUD_nU-yhB1W7lf/spc/wH4Qq0SAN53kYsxTbFfxG6HOhjagfrFJRBuGLYuxt-CAE-Qz6oGpozLvw7G_HMXcJ8-0gcG-1GfGN6PrMkyD7EZ1/vprv/1/ns/Mph4