ustic Guitars - Harsimran Singh Bhatia\n\nProject Managers: Madhura Rumde, Tanvi Seth\n\nProduction House: EO2 EXP\nVideo Producers - Risheeta and Rishabh Agrawal\nDirector - Pankhuri Ranjan \nExecutive Producer - Farzeen Khan\nAssociate Producer - Ramin Yazeshani\nFinancial Controller - Karpu Swami\nDOP - Leslie D’souza\n1st AD - Malhar Wakde\nDA - Smera Juneja\n2nd AD - Rupali Khandelwal\n\nLead male actor - Tejas Ravishankar\nLead female actor - Vidushi Kaul\nProduction Manager -Tanvi Agarwal\nCostume Stylist - Ayushi & Rajvee \nHair & Makeup Artist - Sapna\nProduction Designer - Anish Pandey\n\nChoreographer - Neeraj Lohani \n\nPost Producer -  Priti Rai \nAssociate Post Producer - Rishabh Agarwal\nEditor - Nathan Dcosta\nGrade Artist - Uday Oswal\n\nHUSN lyrics\n\nParagraph 1\n\nDekho Dekho \nKaisi baatein yahan ki \nHain saath par \nHain saath na bhi\nKya itni aasaan hain?\n\nDekho Dekho \nJaise mere iraaday\nWaise kahaan \nTere yahan the\nHaan kitni naadan main\n\nChorus 1\n\nMere husn ke ilawa\nKabhi dil bhi maang lo na\nHaye pal mein \nMain pighal jaun haan \n\nAb aisa na karo \nKe dil judna paye wapis\nTeri baaton\nSe bikhar jaun haan \n\nParagraph 2\n\nMana zamana hai deewana\nIsilye tune na jana \nTere liye main \nKaafi hoon \n\nDekho Dekho \nYeh zamane se thak kar \nAtey ho kyun masoom ban kar?\nTere liye main \nKya hi hoon?\n\nChorus 2\n\nPhir aatey kyun yahan\nKarne aankhon mein \nHo baarish?\nAb aye \nToh theher jao na\n\nAur poocho na zara \nMere din ke bare mein bhi\nBas itne mein \nSambhal jaun haan \n\nPre – Bridge\n\nHaan ek din \nKabhi koi \nJab bhi padhe \nKahani teri\n\nLagta mujhe\nMere naam ka \nZikr kahin \nBhi hoga nahin\n\nBridge\n\nHaan \nMain yahin \nMeri yeh aankhon mein \nAankhon mein toh dekho \n\nDekho yeh dil ka haal kya \nHothon se hota na bayan \nMeri yeh aankhon mein \nAankhon mein toh dekho \n\nKaisa naseeb hai mera\nMilke bhi na mujhe mila \nMeri yeh aankhon mein \nAankhon mein toh dekho \n\nTeri adhuri si wafa \nMaangu main maangu aur na \nMeri yeh aankhon mein \nAankhon mein toh dekho \n\nParagraph 3\n\nDekho Dekho\nKaisi kheenchi lakeerein\nChahe bhi dil toh bhi na jeete\nMain iss daud mein nahin\n\nDekho Dekho \nKaisi baatein yahan ki \nBaatein yahi dekhoon jahan bhi \nMain is daur se nahin","channel_id":"UCafUh796DToiY2U3s7X_WTw","channel_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCafUh796DToiY2U3s7X_WTw","duration":239,"view_count":249162655,"average_rating":null,"age_limit":0,"webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gJLVTKhTnog","categories":["Music"],"tags":[],"playable_in_embed":true,"live_status":"not_live","media_type":"video","release_timestamp":1701354608,"_format_sort_fields":["quality","res","fps","hdr:12","source","vcodec","channels","acodec","lang","proto"],"automatic_captions":{"ab":[{"ext":"json3","url":"https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=gJLVTKhTnog&ei=N6JfabTLB8DAssUPm9SOyQw&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1767900327&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=915CCD975A1DD79EB2369BEFB4A4D9251F4124FD.D42FA9BD5103DCC63352F82DF355021A9CFEC7A8&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=hi&fmt=json3&tlang=ab","name":"Abkhazian","impersonate":true,"__yt_dlp_client":"android_sdkless"},{"ext":"srv1","url":"https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=gJLVTKhTnog&ei=N6JfabTLB8DAssUPm9SOyQw&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1767900327&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=915CCD975A1DD79EB2369BEFB4A4D9251F4124FD.D42FA9BD5103DCC63352F82DF355021A9CFEC7A8&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=hi&fmt=srv1&tlang=ab","name":"Abkhazian","impersonate":true,"__yt_dlp_client":"android_sdkless"},{"ext":"srv2","url":"https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=gJLVTKhTnog&ei=N6JfabTLB8DAssUPm9SOyQw&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1767900327&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=915CCD975A1DD79EB2369BEFB4A4D9251F4124FD.D42FA9BD5103DC