C0n_jw","height":138,"width":246,"preference":-7,"id":"36","resolution":"246x138"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/czMGx5WT0jM/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEcCNACELwBSFXyq4qpAw4IARUAAIhCGAFwAcABBg==&rs=AOn4CLAYRJ67MUDwsW2MmGPLweuMSx2OPA","height":188,"width":336,"preference":-7,"id":"37","resolution":"336x188"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/czMGx5WT0jM/hqdefault.jpg?sqp=-oaymwEjCNACELwBSFryq4qpAxUIARUAAAAAGAElAADIQj0AgKJDeAE=&rs=AOn4CLD5LjYVPrgf6xjqWwVXQCSQujXlbg","height":188,"width":336,"preference":-7,"id":"38","resolution":"336x188"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/czMGx5WT0jM/hqdefault.webp","height":360,"width":480,"preference":-6,"id":"39","resolution":"480x360"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/czMGx5WT0jM/sddefault.jpg","preference":-5,"id":"40"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/czMGx5WT0jM/sddefault.webp","height":480,"width":640,"preference":-4,"id":"41","resolution":"640x480"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/czMGx5WT0jM/hq720.jpg","preference":-3,"id":"42"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/czMGx5WT0jM/hq720.webp","preference":-2,"id":"43"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/czMGx5WT0jM/maxresdefault.jpg","height":1080,"width":1920,"preference":-1,"id":"44","resolution":"1920x1080"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/czMGx5WT0jM/maxresdefault.webp","height":1080,"width":1920,"preference":0,"id":"45","resolution":"1920x1080"}],"thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/czMGx5WT0jM/maxresdefault.webp","description":"Tere Bina Saza – Rooh - A Heart Touching Punjabi Love Sad Song by Tej Gill\nNot every love story ends with happiness… sometimes separation becomes the biggest punishment.\nIn this song, Tej Gill pours his heart out with a soulful voice that beautifully expresses pain and emotions.\nIf you’ve ever lost someone you loved, this track will surely touch your heart. ❤️\n\nTej Gill is a well-known Punjabi singer and songwriter who has carved his own place in the Punjabi music industry. He is best known for his romantic songs, club bangers, and heartfelt lyrics that connect deeply with the audience.\n\nListen to his soulful songs\nRooh - https://youtu.be/0_wXaGnY8Ow?si=Z30jLmdXvJ2IafO2\nKasam Re - https://youtu.be/wE8Zfbg3rm4?si=rLZ5q-lj6ACsf9I2\n \n\nSubscribe to the below link.\nhttps://www.youtube.com/@MOVIEBOXrecordLABEL\n\nCatch more trending Punjabi tracks people can’t stop playing \nPunjabi Hits of All Time\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=f2LOjT6zRCM&list=PLkCEdVkZvreO-3ZacPDrKCZm0MLhX8inl\nBest Punjabi Playlist \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JwSB9gbA2fw&list=PLkCEdVkZvreNEFgG8ooC7ZRKpLnNJkg8U  \n\nMetadata/Credits:\nSinger - Tej Gill\nMusic Director - XD Pro Music\nVideo: Cineverse\nSong Name : Rooh/रूह/ਰੂਹ\n\n#Rooh#PunjabiSong #PunjabiMusic #NewPunjabiSong #LoveSong #RomanticSong\n\nStay updated with Super Hit Punjabi Music Videos.\nUK Bhangra Hits 2000’s \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9kSVs8u5H80&list=PLkCEdVkZvreOBPrztEOUG-sRtTJ4q4jwe&pp=0gcJCXwEOCosWNin \nMost Played Punjabi Songs \nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qWduXD3JKlc&list=PLkCEdVkZvreMnWmY3GhgmKhPD3pnbp6Tv\n\nSong Lyrics:\nKehnda ae dil mera mainu,\nTere naal mohabbatan pawaan\n\nTera vaal vinga na hove,\nNi teri ayi toh main mar jawan,\nKehnda ae dil mera mainu.\n\nTere bina jeena saza ho gaya ve sanu,\nIshq tere da nasha ho gaya ni sanu \nIshq tere da nasha ho gaya ni sadaa \nNi sada tere bina jeena saza ho gaya...\n\nRaatan nu neend na aave,\nDil tainu vekhna chahve,\nRuk gaiyan ghadiyan sohniye,\nIk pal na kateya jaave\n\nTere bina jeena saza ho gaya ve sanu,\nIshq tere da nasha ho gaya ni sanu \nIshq tere da nasha ho gaya ni sadaa \nNi sada tere bina jeena saza ho gaya...\n\nTeri main rooh ban jawan,\nHiriye,\nTeri main rooh ban jawan,\nSoniye,\nZulfaan di shaan ban jawan,\nBullan te shaan ban jawan,\n\nEhna khayal’an vich main kho gaya ni hun,\nTera diwana jaane ‘Tej’ ho gaya ni hun \nTera diwana jaane ‘Tej’ ho gaya...\n\nTere bina jeena,\nSaza ho gaya ve sanu,\nIshq tere da,\nNasha ho gaya ni sanu\n\nNi sada tere bina jeena,\nSaza ho gaya.\n\nSohniye meri sohniye,\nHiriye meri hiriye...\"\n\nListen to Kasam Re By Tej Gill ► https://youtu.be/wE8Zfbg3rm4\n\n#rooh \n#tejgill \n#punjabisong \n#sadpunjabisong \n#lovesong","channel_id":"UCyYhB1bENJloiVoK1Hod_vg","channel_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCyYhB1bENJloiVoK1Hod_vg","duration":221,"view_count":151846866,"average_rating":null,"age_limit":0,"webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=czMGx5WT0jM","categories":["Music"],"tags":["Tere Bina Saza","Tere Bina Saza song","Tere Bina Saza Tej Gill","Tej Gill songs","Tej Gill new song","Punjabi love song","Punjabi sad song","new Punjabi song 2025","Punjabi breakup song","heart touching Punjabi song","emotional Punjabi song","romantic sad Punjabi song","best Punjabi songs","latest Punjabi sad songs","trending Punjabi songs","soulful Punjabi songs","Tej Gill sad song","Punjabi dard song","true love Punjabi song","Punjabi song 2025"],"playable_in_embed":true,"live_status":"not_live","media_type":"video","release_timestamp":null,"_format_sort_fields":["quality","res","fps","hdr:12","source","vcodec","channels","acodec","lang","proto"],"automatic_captions":{"ab":[{"ext":"json3","url":"https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=czMGx5WT0jM&ei=HaRfafGOAefoqfkP5P7HqQs&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1767900813&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=2B19B3DB20F43590B7FAC5BA3D00E8AD032064FF.6770E9AFD04D462B9181C8481ADCEC8DF15B267C&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=pa&fmt=json3&tlang=ab","name":"Abkhazian","impersonate":true,"__yt_dlp_client":"android_sdkless"},{"ext":"srv1","url":"https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=czMGx5WT0jM&ei=HaRfafGOAefoqfkP5P7HqQs&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1767900813&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=2B19B3DB20F43590B7FAC5BA3D00E8AD032064FF.6770E9AFD04D462B9181C8481ADCEC8DF15B267C&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=pa&fmt=srv1&tlang=ab","name":"Abkhazian","