M/hq720.webp","preference":-2,"id":"43"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qoq8B8ThgEM/maxresdefault.jpg","height":1080,"width":1920,"preference":-1,"id":"44","resolution":"1920x1080"},{"url":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/qoq8B8ThgEM/maxresdefault.webp","height":1080,"width":1920,"preference":0,"id":"45","resolution":"1920x1080"}],"thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi_webp/qoq8B8ThgEM/maxresdefault.webp","description":"Trending Moments:\n🎬 00:18 - Tu Hi Toh Jannat Meri\n🎬 00:42 - Tujh Mein Rab Dikhta Hai, Yaara Main Kya Karoon\n🎬 01:33 - Kaisi Hai Yeh Doori, Kaisi Majboori\n\nWhen your beloved becomes your God and love becomes your prayers. Steal the moment and tell your beloved 'Tujh Mein Rab Dikhta Hai’!\n► Subscribe Now: https://goo.gl/xs3mrY 🔔 Stay updated!\n#YRFnewreleases - https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLCB05E03DA939D484\n\n🎧 Song Credits:\nSong: Tujh Mein Rab Dikhta Hai\nMusic: Salim-Sulaiman\nLyrics: Jaideep Sahni\nSinger: Roop Kumar Rathod\n\nStay in the filmy loop:\n► Like us on Facebook: Facebook/yrf \n► Follow us on X: x.com/yrf\n► Follow us on Instagram: Instagram/yrf\n► Visit us on: yashrajfilms.com\n\n🎬 Movie Credits:\nStarring: Shah Rukh Khan, Anushka Sharma & Vinay Pathak\nDirector: Aditya Chopra\nProducers: Yash Chopra & Aditya Chopra\nMusic: Salim-Sulaiman\nLyrics: Jaideep Sahni\nDirector of Photography: Ravi K. Chandran I.S.C.\nRelease Date: 12 December 2008\n\nWatch all videos from the film ‘Rab Ne Bana Di Jodi’: https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL91A20F9AEEDF08A4\n\nSynopsis:\nHave you ever stopped to think if the most ordinary, uninteresting, unobtrusive man you might see on the road or around you might have a love story to tell? Maybe not! How can an ordinary man have a breathtaking, goose flesh igniting, awe inspiring love story of all things to tell?\n\nThis is what happened to Surinder Sahni (Shah Rukh Khan) - a simple, clean hearted, honest man, leading a humdrum life, when he meets his total opposite and finds love in the flamboyant, fun-loving, vivacious - Taani (Anushka Sharma) for whom the whole world is her canvas and she paints her own life with the colours of rainbow all until unforeseen circumstances changes it all and brings them together.\n\nWhat follows is a journey filled with laughter, tears, joy, pain, music, dance and a lot of love. A journey that makes us believe that there is an extraordinary love story in every ordinary jodi (couple).\n\n#YRFnewreleases #RabNeBanaDiJodi #YRF #LoveForever #ShahRukhKhan #AnushkaSharma #SalimSulaiman #JaideepSahni #VinayPathak #RoopKumarRathod\n\n© Yash Raj Films Pvt. Ltd.","channel_id":"UCbTLwN10NoCU4WDzLf1JMOA","channel_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCbTLwN10NoCU4WDzLf1JMOA","duration":281,"view_count":1404299767,"average_rating":null,"age_limit":0,"webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qoq8B8ThgEM","categories":["Music"],"tags":["shah rukh khan songs","anushka sharma songs","rab ne bana di jodi song","tujhme rab dikhta hai song","shahrukh khan songs","indian songs","bollywood songs","اغاني شاه روخ خان","tu hi to jannat meri song","roop kumar songs","เพลงอินเดีย","tujhme rab dikhta hai","hindi songs","tu hi to jannat meri","tu hi toh jannat meri","tu hi rooh ka sukoon","tu hi akhiyon ki thandak","kaisi hai yeh doori kaisi majboori","srk love song","srk anushka song","srk romantic song","sajde sar jhukta hai","lagu india"],"playable_in_embed":true,"live_status":"not_live","media_type":"video","release_timestamp":null,"_format_sort_fields":["quality","res","fps","hdr:12","source","vcodec","channels","acodec","lang","proto"],"automatic_captions":{},"subtitles":{},"comment_count":201000,"chapters":[{"start_time":0,"end_time":18,"title":"<Untitled Chapter 1>"},{"start_time":18,"title":"Tu Hi Toh Jannat Meri","end_time":42},{"start_time":42,"title":"Tujh Mein Rab Dikhta Hai, Yaara Main Kya Karoon","end_time":93},{"start_time":93,"title":"Kaisi Hai Yeh Doori, Kaisi Majboori","end_time":281}],"heatmap":[{"start_time":0,"end_time":2.8