n►Instagram: https://www.instagram.com/reels/audio/1070490898558590/\n-------------------------------------------\n\nStream Almost Loved EP from here:\n-------------------------------------------------------------\n♪ Spotify: https://open.spotify.com/album/0CQD8Onjot6D9Xw3zbVE96\n\n♪ Gaana: https://gaana.com/album/almost-love-hindi\n\n♪ Jio Saavn: https://www.jiosaavn.com/album/almost-loved/Whv0bQ8mils_\n\n♪ Apple Music: https://music.apple.com/us/album/almost-loved-single/1830109076\n\n♪ Amazon Music: https://music.amazon.com/albums/B0FKK3WF7K\n\n♪YouTube Music: https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=OLAK5uy_kQlJ4GTDrNFVAMf3X7R1Ddpm24unzuxgI \n-------------------------------\n\nLyrics:\n-----------------\nAaja maahi \nAaja mahi \n\nAaja maahi \nAaja mahi \n\nJaane naa tu \nKe tera kitna khhyal me karun\nIshq me hoon toh phir \nItne sawaal kyu karun\n\nChedkhaaniyaan \nHaan haan \nNazre teri karti yahaan \nIttar saa tu \nHaan haan \nMujhme hi fir ghul sa gyaa\n\nAaja maahi \nAaja mahi \n\nAaja maahi \nAaja mahi \n\nHaan aafreen lagne lge jab dekhe tu is tarhaa \nFir laazmi hona hi tha , ye dil tera jo huaa\nShak hi nahi isme koi tujhsaa haseen hogaa hi naa \nTakkti rahi nazrein meri wah kamaal kya kia \n\nKya me kaarun \nBass itna btaa de zraa \nWaazib nahi \nGar tu jo mujhe naa milaa\n\nChedkhaaniyaan \nHaan haan \nNazre teri karti yahaan \nIttar saa tu \nHaan haan\nMujhme hi phir ghul sa gaya\n\nAaja maahi \nAaja mahi \n\nAaja maahi \nAaja mahi \n\nYaad h ky wo \nDin bhi tujhe \nJab pehli dafa hum mile\nJo ijhaar dil ne kiya\nDono hi sharmaagye\n\nTakragye jo is tarha\nHo kya gyaa jaanu hi naa \nAb jo mila saath tera \nMangu kya me yahaan \n\nSaari umaaar \nBas teri fikar me jiyunn \nMera jo bhi bas \nTere hawaale karun\n\nChedkhaaniyaan \nHaan haan \nNazre teri karti yahaan \nIttar saa tu \nHaan haan\nMujhme hi phir ghul sa gaya\n\nAaja maahi\nAaja mahi\n\nAaja maahi \nAaja mahi \n\n------------------------------------------------------------------\nEnjoy & Stay Connected With UR Debut On:\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/urdebut/\nFacebook: https://www.facebook.com/urdebut\nTwitter: https://twitter.com/UrDebut","channel_id":"UCG3VCErvT_bRm_q1LQXUTBg","channel_url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCG3VCErvT_bRm_q1LQXUTBg","duration":190,"view_count":18053754,"average_rating":null,"age_limit":0,"webpage_url":"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dp2OYt_2O9E","categories":["Music"],"tags":["hindi love song","hindi romantic song","new romantic song","bhoomi","bhoomi new song","bhumi","bhumi songs","bhumi new song","romantic songs","romantic love songs","debut love songs","ur debut channa ve","indie","indie songs","indie music","indie artist","indie music hindi","indie songs hindi","jaane na tu song","jaane na tu bhoomi","bhoomi jaane na tu","jane na tu bhoomi","almost loved bhoomi","almost loved ep"],"playable_in_embed":true,"live_status":"not_live","media_type":"video","release_timestamp":null,"_format_sort_fields":["quality","res","fps","hdr:12","source","vcodec","channels","acodec","lang","proto"],"automatic_captions":{"ab":[{"ext":"json3","url":"https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=dp2OYt_2O9E&ei=g79faamuNJfI9fwP0-rz4AI&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&xospf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1767907827&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=346CC737E190914AF15EB51C4DCA108A4D65DE04.43753D315A4D4AF8A797FDBD6FF0E9444C883B60&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=hi&fmt=json3&tlang=ab","name":"Abkhazian","impersonate":true,"__yt_dlp_client":"android_sdkless"},{"ext":"srv1","url":"https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=dp2OYt_2O9E&ei=g79faamuNJfI9fwP0-rz4AI&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&xospf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1767907827&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=346CC737E190914AF15EB51C4DCA108A4D65DE04.43753D315A4D4AF8A797FDBD6FF0E9444C883B60&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=hi&fmt=srv1&tlang=ab","name":"Abkhazian","impersonate":true,"__yt_dlp_client":"android_sdkles